[{"id":162778745,"discussion_id":"6c96a0745c3b5666043a1229d6ba39ef94019f34","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-transformer/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| moe | ✅ [*chen-linxin4*](https://gitcode.com/chen-linxin4), [*cc-z*](https://gitcode.com/cc-z) (2/2) | ✅ [*chen-linxin4*](https://gitcode.com/chen-linxin4), [*cc-z*](https://gitcode.com/cc-z) (2/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n","created_at":"2026-02-10T15:19:41+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-10T17:27:08+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162778762,"discussion_id":"18e00154f6ea1f7f18fa22a384a62d7233b3a47c","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-02-10T15:19:44+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-10T15:19:44+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162778777,"discussion_id":"d411ae9389f27e6d5952911308483af4f83ec8dc","body":"### CLA Signature Pass  \n kdy18482276080, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1: ","created_at":"2026-02-10T15:19:47+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-10T15:19:47+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162778977,"discussion_id":"b8e67735a0ab507ca0343c7179e1698d921e8266","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复动态量化内核在处理输入特征维度为零（`cols_ == 0`）时的边界条件问题。当输入数据为空时，原有的计算流程可能无法正常执行量化操作，导致后续依赖量化缩放因子的操作（如数据拷贝）出现未定义行为或错误。本次修改旨在确保在此特殊边界条件下，内核能够安全、健壮地运行，避免潜在的内存访问或逻辑错误。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n在 `MoeV2FullLoadDynamicQuant::Process` 和 `MoeV2GatherDynamicQuant::Process` 函数的执行入口处，新增了对输入特征维度（`cols_`）的检查。当检测到 `cols_` 为零时，立即从 `scaleOutQueue` 分配一个本地浮点张量，使用 `Duplicate` 函数将其所有元素初始化为 `0.0`，然后立即释放该张量。这一防御性编程措施确保了量化缩放因子输出队列在后续流程中拥有一个有效的、已初始化的张量，从而保证了整个流程在空输入场景下的数据一致性和安全性。","created_at":"2026-02-10T15:20:34+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-10T15:20:34+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162779956,"discussion_id":"201813346cafc8c925b3c334a84a710be702b723","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-02-10T15:24:34+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-10T15:24:34+08:00","user":{"id":"688489b743e100195d9528c9","login":"kdy1848227608